		(comp
			(ref "Z301")
			(value "66 x 200 V")
			(description "Clamp string on N1, to REF: 66 avalanche parts of the 200 V class in series (1.5KE200A class), BV 13.2 kV at 1 mA. It holds N1 at 13.13 kV, x1.50 under the gap's 19.70 kV, and takes 0.79 W (12 mW per part, 0.64 mA peak) (rebuild/s1_tube/s1b_clamp_results.json). Disconnect it to run the bench without a limit (the designer, 2026-10-16).")
